        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GameSyndicates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create, customize, and play your own interactive worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GameSyndicates</strong> is all about <strong>imagination</strong>, <strong>creativity</strong>, and <strong>play</strong>. Design anything—from tropical islands to futuristic space scenes—and make it come alive. Place themed tiles, shape skies and environments, and bring objects to life with modular components. Worlds start simple, but quickly grow into interactive adventures filled with vehicles, enemies, actors, and your own unique creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative World Building</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/05868a80ff0a581e7825e26df664f782.poster.avif?t=1774690398\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/05868a80ff0a581e7825e26df664f782.webm?t=1774690398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place tiles from <strong>themed</strong> <strong>packs</strong> to design beaches, cities, haunted forests, or space stations. Copy, replace, and expand worlds however you like. Tiles are never in a final state—the system is <strong>built for expansion</strong>, with new themed packs adding fresh possibilities and adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/c1bf2647199cbe263889ea13bfa85957.poster.avif?t=1774690398\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/c1bf2647199cbe263889ea13bfa85957.webm?t=1774690398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Change the sky, sun, moon, clouds, weather, and lighting to set the mood of your world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Components</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/c5015b88be3d1093e2528dd0e8ab7bf5.poster.avif?t=1774690398\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/c5015b88be3d1093e2528dd0e8ab7bf5.webm?t=1774690398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use versatile <strong>controllers</strong> to add <strong>interactions</strong>—doors, switches, elevators, destructible objects, glowing effects, flying cameras, control logic, and more. Combine them with <strong>event-driven commands</strong> to create anything from simple triggers to complex sequences. These components are <strong>never final</strong>—they continue to <strong>evolve</strong>, expanding based on players needs and requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reusable Scripts</strong> <br>Any interaction you build can be copied and reused across different worlds, making creation faster and easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Media Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your worlds with your own textures, sounds, and even videos by linking external URLs. This gives you unlimited freedom to make every creation truly yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional PCOM Scripting</strong><br>For creators who want more, PCOM offers a retro-style scripting language inspired by C64 BASIC for deeper interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with others using classic online multiplayer, where worlds can be uploaded to the game server and shared globally. Or go off-grid with <strong>incognito multiplayer</strong>—upload worlds anywhere you like (Dropbox, Google Drive, your own server) and play directly with friends outside the official system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guided Learning</strong><br>Start quickly with tutorial worlds, example projects, videos, and documentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play GameSyndicates?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike typical builders, GameSyndicates combines easy-to-use creative tools with powerful optional scripting. Build beautiful environments, make them interactive, and reuse your creations endlessly—all in one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create anything. Make it playable. Share your imagination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows players to import external textures, sounds, videos, and custom in-game text via internet links (URLs). Such content is user-generated and not provided or moderated by the developer. Players are solely responsible for the legality, safety, and appropriateness of any external content they use or create.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GameSyndicates</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create, customize, and play your own interactive worlds.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GameSyndicates</strong> is all about <strong>imagination</strong>, <strong>creativity</strong>, and <strong>play</strong>. Design anything—from tropical islands to futuristic space scenes—and make it come alive. Place themed tiles, shape skies and environments, and bring objects to life with modular components. Worlds start simple, but quickly grow into interactive adventures filled with vehicles, enemies, actors, and your own unique creations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative World Building</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/05868a80ff0a581e7825e26df664f782.poster.avif?t=1774690398\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/05868a80ff0a581e7825e26df664f782.webm?t=1774690398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place tiles from <strong>themed</strong> <strong>packs</strong> to design beaches, cities, haunted forests, or space stations. Copy, replace, and expand worlds however you like. Tiles are never in a final state—the system is <strong>built for expansion</strong>, with new themed packs adding fresh possibilities and adventures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Environments</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/c1bf2647199cbe263889ea13bfa85957.poster.avif?t=1774690398\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/c1bf2647199cbe263889ea13bfa85957.webm?t=1774690398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Change the sky, sun, moon, clouds, weather, and lighting to set the mood of your world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Components</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/c5015b88be3d1093e2528dd0e8ab7bf5.poster.avif?t=1774690398\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874310/extras/c5015b88be3d1093e2528dd0e8ab7bf5.webm?t=1774690398\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use versatile <strong>controllers</strong> to add <strong>interactions</strong>—doors, switches, elevators, destructible objects, glowing effects, flying cameras, control logic, and more. Combine them with <strong>event-driven commands</strong> to create anything from simple triggers to complex sequences. These components are <strong>never final</strong>—they continue to <strong>evolve</strong>, expanding based on players needs and requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reusable Scripts</strong> <br>Any interaction you build can be copied and reused across different worlds, making creation faster and easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Media Support</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your worlds with your own textures, sounds, and even videos by linking external URLs. This gives you unlimited freedom to make every creation truly yours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional PCOM Scripting</strong><br>For creators who want more, PCOM offers a retro-style scripting language inspired by C64 BASIC for deeper interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play together with others using classic online multiplayer, where worlds can be uploaded to the game server and shared globally. Or go off-grid with <strong>incognito multiplayer</strong>—upload worlds anywhere you like (Dropbox, Google Drive, your own server) and play directly with friends outside the official system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guided Learning</strong><br>Start quickly with tutorial worlds, example projects, videos, and documentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why Play GameSyndicates?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike typical builders, GameSyndicates combines easy-to-use creative tools with powerful optional scripting. Build beautiful environments, make them interactive, and reuse your creations endlessly—all in one game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create anything. Make it playable. Share your imagination.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game allows players to import external textures, sounds, videos, and custom in-game text via internet links (URLs). Such content is user-generated and not provided or moderated by the developer. Players are solely responsible for the legality, safety, and appropriateness of any external content they use or create.</p>",
